text:
alejandra: quick checkWe need a decision for the JS SDK packaging. Single package with conditional exports or split into @redwood/sdk + @redwood/sdk-cjs? Edge-only runtimes require ESM, but many users still call require(). Also types resolution is flakey for some customers. thoughts?

todd: my vote is single-package. fewer releases, easier docs. conditional exports are annoying but manageable if we keep exports small and add root index.cjs/index.mjs files.

mina: single-package ok but we must explicitly ship an edge shim. Edge can't use node-only auth helpers (fs, tls, native KMS libs). Put an ./edge entry and document auth/retry differences there. We saw a customer hit duplicate side effects when our retry behavior retried non-idempotent calls on Vercel Edge.

alejandra: types question: should "types" point at ./dist/index.d.ts or ./esm/index.d.ts? TS sometimes resolves the wrong file when package has multiple builds.

todd: point to ./dist/index.d.ts and add typesVersions for older TS consumers. Example we tested:

{
  "main": "./cjs/index.js",
  "module": "./esm/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "import": "./esm/index.js",
      "require": "./cjs/index.js"
    },
    "./edge": {
      "import": "./edge/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  }
}

mina: also include index.cjs and index.mjs at the package root that re-export into dist. legacy bundlers and some CLIs still look for those.

publish-bot: note: splitting into two packages doubles release surface and CVE/patch work. ops prefers single-package unless there's a strong DX reason.

ci-bot: CI got flaky across node 16/18/20 when we added conditional exports. Recommend pinning test runners in matrix and add smoke tests: require('..') in a CJS runner, import in ESM runner, run in a Cloudflare worker and Next Edge function. also add a TS resolution smoke that does `tsc --noEmit` in example repos.

alejandra: good call. mina can you draft a minimal example layout and a smoke harness? include examples/sdk-node-cjs and examples/sdk-edge so onboarding docs can link them.

mina: will do. plan: prototype single-package with explicit exports map, root index files, edge subpath, types -> ./dist/index.d.ts, small examples, and a 4-case smoke matrix (cjs, esm, edge, types). i'll open WIP PR and tag this thread. assigning to myself. :sparkles:
